; ATTREQ 0 (0.8.1-PT17, #941; docs/adr/0056, point 3): -INSERT asks nothing, as in the 0.8,
; and every ATTRIB takes its default (docs/adr/0045, point 6). ATTREQ is a value of the
; session: set before OPEN, it still holds in the drawing opened, and ATTREQ proposes it.
; Prompt of ATTREQ as the other values of the session (PEDITACCEPT, TRIMEXTENDMODE) and as
; autocad-attributi.txt ("Digitare nuovo valore per ATTREQ <1>:").
; Matleyx78/dxf-test-file, commit 2aafbb1fa17abc67fdf2ff7de26a34b70e79b736 (CC0-1.0):
; autocad-attributi.scr and autocad-attributi.txt (AutoCAD 2021, Italian, translated as
; docs/adr/0056, point 3).
; componente.dxf is handwritten, as the cases of insert/: block COMPONENTE with the six
; ATTDEFs of autocad-attributi.dxf, same tags, prompts, defaults, modes, points, height and
; order (SIGLA, POSIZIONE, TENSIONE, COSTRUTTORE, NOTA, CODICE), on layer 0 with style
; Standard. Left out, because they change nothing in the prompts: the rectangle, the style
; ARIAL of TENSIONE (a STYLE table would only add a line to the report) and the Lock
; position of SIGLA (its second group 280 is 0: PT15, a later wave, writes lock-position
; and lists no case to update).
; ~box (docs/adr/0022): LiberationSans-Regular.ttf of resources/fonts, read with a small
; reader of its head, hhea, OS/2, cmap and hmtx tables: cap height 1409, ascent 1854,
; descent -434. An ATTDEF shows its tag; an ATTRIB is its ATTDEF moved by the insertion
; point (docs/adr/0045, point 6; docs/adr/0031, point 2: both points move).
ATTREQ
0
OPEN
componente.dxf
-INSERT
COMPONENTE
0,-40
1

0
ATTREQ

